**/target
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store
.claude/
project_docs/
logs/
docs/.codebase-snapshot.md
.manifest.toml
docs/specs/
docs/plans/
# The plan-loop machinery under docs/scripts/ is local tooling, but the four
# repository boundary checks below are named by .github/workflows/ci.yml and must
# exist in a fresh checkout. So must check_lib.sh: all four source it, and a
# checkout without it fails every boundary check at line one. Ignoring the
# directory itself would stop git descending into it, so the entries are ignored
# and the five files re-included.
docs/scripts/*
!docs/scripts/check_lang_feature_forwarding.sh
!docs/scripts/check_lib.sh
!docs/scripts/check_published_manifests.sh
!docs/scripts/check_syntax_capabilities.sh
!docs/scripts/check_syntax_dependency_closure.sh
docs/internal/
docs/planning_guidelines.md
docs/introspection_guidelines.md
docs/rust_profile.md
docs/design-rationale.md
docs/testing.md
.mcp.json
